{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqiu6f2zd0k","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","title":"Background (run_in_background) workers self-register via start_task, not the SubagentStart hook","summary":"The SubagentStart hook does NOT fire for run_in_background Agent-tool spawns (they use .output paths, not .jsonl), so such workers never carry agent_tool_spawn:true. The overlay claim path treats a start_task claim that bears an agent_id AND is backed by a registered worktree as a legitimate hook-less worker and registers it on claim — a claim with no worktree is still refused. Thus the branch_task→start_task order IS the registration.","created_by":null,"valid_from":"2026-06-18T01:43:49.979Z","vec":[-0.06254006922245026,-0.02017086371779442,-0.061469681560993195,0.024289533495903015,0.04377465695142746,-0.033977508544921875,-0.010360523127019405,0.023882489651441574,-0.009662473574280739,0.018894709646701813,-0.025595566257834435,0.013739112764596939,-0.02358805201947689,0.06011100858449936,0.00013212382327765226,0.07735726237297058,0.057488344609737396,-0.04920213297009468,0.04660115763545036,-0.07961254566907883,-0.010861802846193314,0.0035342341288924217,0.0304661113768816,0.03928939998149872,-0.06257693469524384,-0.07224574685096741,-0.04119990020990372,0.026012469083070755,0.0735803097486496,0.004872554447501898,0.025178566575050354,0.02650582231581211,0.004827701952308416,-0.004257572814822197,0.12145081162452698,0.08136845380067825,0.04454273730516434,-0.04678330570459366,-0.028122734278440475,0.07423332333564758,0.13105688989162445,0.004076612181961536,-0.08516119420528412,-0.06182849034667015,-0.05897139757871628,0.03919149562716484,0.008273055776953697,-0.04070495441555977,-0.08649998158216476,0.06123592332005501,0.043236855417490005,-0.05492947995662689,0.07784385979175568,0.007087316829711199,-0.06044089421629906,0.029302414506673813,0.021148648113012314,-0.0159721989184618,0.011997326277196407,0.021594900637865067,0.021137313917279243,-0.05583815649151802,0.0180473253